# Respect default shortcuts.
$include /etc/inputrc

## arrow up
"\e[A":history-search-backward
## arrow down
"\e[B":history-search-forward

## ⌥+Delete：以空白為界刪整個字詞（預設 backward-kill-word 只認英數，
## `cli --arg` 會一段段刪、甚至連 cli 一起吃掉）。unix-word-rubout 只用空白當分隔。
"\e\C-?": unix-word-rubout
"\e\C-h": unix-word-rubout
